Subject: [PATCH] branding: set the application vendor to Nulavio

MOZ_APP_VENDOR can only be implied by the project configure file, not set
from a mozconfig. The vendor feeds application.ini "Vendor" and the default
profile location, keeping Nulavio's data out of Mozilla-named directories.

Owner: Nulavio maintainers
Upstream: not applicable (branding choice); revisit if upstream exposes the
option to mozconfig.
---
--- a/browser/moz.configure	2026-10-24 22:49:55.987097714 -0300
+++ b/browser/moz.configure	2026-10-24 22:49:55.990287245 -0300
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
 imply_option("MOZ_PROFILE_MIGRATOR", True)
 
 
-imply_option("MOZ_APP_VENDOR", "Mozilla")
+imply_option("MOZ_APP_VENDOR", "Nulavio")
 imply_option("MOZ_APP_ID", "{ec8030f7-c20a-464f-9b0e-13a3a9e97384}")
 # Include the DevTools client, not just the server (which is the default)
 imply_option("MOZ_DEVTOOLS", "all")
